M03 soft-lock: primary objective 1008 ("access the Comm Center mainframe")
can stay pending forever. 1008 is added by 308,3 from a base-entry zone; the
terminal 1100009 (RMV_M03_Comm_Center_Terminal) sends 308,1 when poked. After
a west-elevator entry the conversation-zone callbacks that would send 308,3
are lost (zones 1144502/1100005 destroy themselves through RMV_Trigger_Zone
on the same entry, which nulls the conversation monitor), so 308,3 comes only
from con-yard zone 1144636. A player who pokes the terminal first and crosses
that zone afterwards gets 308,1 before 308,3: the completion is dropped and
1008 is added as pending.

Remember the poke in a saved flag (new id 10) and credit it once when 1008 is
added. In the normal order (add, then poke) the flag is never consulted.
Saves without id 10 load with the flag clear, which is the original behaviour.

